        "y1": 0.4163901515151516
      },
      "text": "For our system with inertia, we start from the equations of motion for the oscillators Eq. (1) and express the coupling term in the dynamics as a multiplicative network noise:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
